   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Clean muted South-Indian classic: neutral-to-cool whites (~214/221/222), matte blacks (~14), low saturation (0.22), skin slightly muted and neutral, aqua tones kept. Best for: Temple / kanjivaram / South-Indian weddings with heavy gold and silk, bright daylight mandaps, frames with a lot of white and cream. Keeps gold from going orange.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
